        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 013 \"T\" Door Strike Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese door latch strike plates are for use with <a href=\"/collections/omnia-levers\"><b>Omnia Leverset</b></a>, <a href=\"/collections/omnia-knobs\"><b>Omnia Knobset</b></a>, <a href=\"/collections/omnia-stainless-steel-levers\"><b>Omnia Stainless Leverset</b></a> and  <a href=\"/collections/omnia-tubular-entrysets\"><b>Omnia Entry Locksets</b></a>. Can also be used with other manufacture's entry locks, passage, and privacy sets.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis \"T\" strike is the standard strike plate supplied with most Omnia door hardware sets.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Dimensions:</b> for Omnia 013 T Door Strike Plate\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Base Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Length from Screw Hole to Lip Edge: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><b>*Sold Individually. </b>\r\n</p>",
